  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>An easy-to-use, microfine gel pencil that fills and defines brows for soft, natural-looking fullness.</p><p><br></p><p ><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: </strong></p><p>Sunflower oil: Rich in nourishing vitamin E and known to provide lightweight moisture.        </p><p>Safflower extract: Encourages softer, more supple hair.         </p><p>Hibiscus flower extract: Rich in amino acids to help condition hair. </p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is vegan and cruelty-free.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>What Else You Need to Know:</strong> Easy to apply and designed to be used only where needed, this micro pencil creates soft strokes to add natural-looking </p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:</strong></p><p >-To create soft fullness, twist up Brow 1990 no more than 1 mm to prevent breakage. Use the precise tip to create soft strokes anywhere you want to fill in gaps or add definition.</p><p>-For a fuller brow, apply Brow 1980 Volumizing Tinted Eyebrow Gel-Pomade (sold separately) first to create volume and hold. Then, twist up Brow 1990’s precise tip and apply directly on top anywhere you want added definition.&nbsp;</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p>Hydrogenated Vegetable Oil, Polyglyceryl-2 Triisostearate, Hydrogenated Coco-Glycerides, Mica, Synthetic Wax, &nbsp;Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Wax, Zinc Stearate, Caprylic/Capric Glycerides, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Polybutene, Tocopheryl Acetate, Sorbitan Tristearate, Aluminum Hydroxide, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Polyglyceryl-3 Diisostearate, Carthamus Tinctorius (Safflower) Flower Extract, Hibiscus Sabdariffa Flower Extract, Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77492), Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891)</p><p><br></p><p><em>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</em></p></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>An easy-to-use, microfine gel pencil that fills and defines brows for soft, natural-looking fullness.</p><p><br></p><p ><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: </strong></p><p>Sunflower oil: Rich in nourishing vitamin E and known to provide lightweight moisture.        </p><p>Safflower extract: Encourages softer, more supple hair.         </p><p>Hibiscus flower extract: Rich in amino acids to help condition hair. </p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is vegan and cruelty-free.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>What Else You Need to Know:</strong> Easy to apply and designed to be used only where needed, this micro pencil creates soft strokes to add natural-looking </p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:</strong></p><p >-To create soft fullness, twist up Brow 1990 no more than 1 mm to prevent breakage. Use the precise tip to create soft strokes anywhere you want to fill in gaps or add definition.</p><p>-For a fuller brow, apply Brow 1980 Volumizing Tinted Eyebrow Gel-Pomade (sold separately) first to create volume and hold. Then, twist up Brow 1990’s precise tip and apply directly on top anywhere you want added definition.&nbsp;</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p>Hydrogenated Vegetable Oil, Polyglyceryl-2 Triisostearate, Hydrogenated Coco-Glycerides, Mica, Synthetic Wax, &nbsp;Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Wax, Zinc Stearate, Caprylic/Capric Glycerides, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Polybutene, Tocopheryl Acetate, Sorbitan Tristearate, Aluminum Hydroxide, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Polyglyceryl-3 Diisostearate, Carthamus Tinctorius (Safflower) Flower Extract, Hibiscus Sabdariffa Flower Extract, Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77492), Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891)</p><p><br></p><p><em>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</em></p></div></details>",
